---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME } from '~/lib/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Affiliate Disclosure | ${BRAND_NAME}`}
  description="How affiliate links work on this site, per FTC guidelines."
>
  <div class="wrap prose page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      Some pages on this site contain affiliate links — for example, links to
      book dog-friendly lodging, reserve activities through Viator, or buy
      gear we recommend. If you click one of these links and make a purchase,
      we may earn a commission. <strong>It costs you nothing extra.</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      In line with the FTC's endorsement guidelines (16 CFR Part 255), every
      page that contains affiliate links displays a disclosure notice near the
      links themselves, and affiliate links are tagged so search engines treat
      them as sponsored.
    </p>
    <h2>What affiliate money does and doesn't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>It helps pay for the ongoing re-verification of every listing.</li>
      <li>It does <strong>not</strong> decide which venues we cover.</li>
      <li>It does <strong>not</strong> change what we report about any venue's dog policy.</li>
      <li>Venues cannot pay for placement or favorable coverage — see our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Questions? Reach out via the contact details on our <a href="/about/">about page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 2rem;
  }
</style>
